# Example Environment Configuration for n8n Pterodactyl Egg

## Basic Configuration (Required)
SERVER_PORT=5678
N8N_HOST=0.0.0.0
N8N_PROTOCOL=http

## SQLite Database
DB_SQLITE_DATABASE=/home/container/.n8n/database.sqlite

## Webhook Configuration
# Replace with your actual server URL
WEBHOOK_URL=http://your-server-ip:5678/

## SSL Configuration (Optional)
# Uncomment and configure if you want to use SSL certificates
# N8N_SSL_KEY=/home/container/certs/key.pem
# N8N_SSL_CERT=/home/container/certs/cert.pem
# N8N_PROTOCOL=https

## Basic Authentication (Optional)
# Uncomment to enable basic authentication
# N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER=admin
# N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD=your-secure-password

## Additional n8n Configuration (Optional)
# You can add any other n8n environment variables here
# See: https://docs.n8n.io/hosting/configuration/environment-variables/

# Examples:
# N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY=your-encryption-key
# EXECUTIONS_TIMEOUT=300
# EXECUTIONS_TIMEOUT_MAX=3600
# N8N_METRICS=true
